  pokidle <command> [args...]

Commands:
  daemon <verb>           Daemon lifecycle:
                            run       Main encounter loop (used by systemd unit)
                            start     Start the systemd user service
                            stop      Stop it
                            restart   Restart it (reload current code)
                            status    systemctl status + current biome + tick state
                            logs [a]  journalctl --user -u pokidle (args passed through)
                            enable    Start on login
                            disable   Don't start on login
  tick <kind> [flags]     Run a single roll now (default: dry-run, no DB write)
                            kind: pokemon | item | level | friendship | evolve | legendary
                            --no-dry-run    Persist DB writes
                            --no-notify     Skip notify-send
                            --json          Emit JSON to stdout
  encounters [filters]    Pretty list of pokemon encounters
                            --shiny           Only shinies
                            --since DATE      Encounters at/after DATE
                            --until DATE      Encounters at/before DATE
                            --biome ID        Filter by biome
                            --species NAME    Substring match on species
                            --nature NAME     Exact nature match
                            --min-iv-total N  Min summed IVs
                            --limit N         Cap rows (default 50)
                            --newest-first    Newest at top (default: bottom)
                            --no-images       Skip inline sprite previews
                            --json            Emit raw JSON
  export [filters]        Random Pokémon Showdown team: up to 6 distinct
                          species from the current week (override window with
                          --since/--until), each given a distinct, Showdown-
                          legal held item from item drops in the same window.
                          Accepts the same filters as encounters.
  items [filters]         Pretty list of item drops
                            --since DATE      Drops at/after DATE
                            --until DATE      Drops at/before DATE
                            --biome ID        Filter by biome
                            --item NAME       Substring match on item
                            --limit N         Cap rows (default 50)
                            --all             Include used (consumed) drops
                            --newest-first    Newest at top (default: bottom)
                            --no-images       Skip inline sprite previews
                            --json            Emit raw JSON
  stats                   Aggregates: totals, shinies, by biome, top species
  current [--items|--encounters] [--no-images]
